      "text": {
        "en": "Clients warmly praise Dr Marco, Dr Allen, and Dr Benitez for their thorough consultations, thoughtful treatment plans, and clear communication. Reviewers frequently mention that doctors get down on the floor to examine pets and reduce anxiety. Owners appreciate that attending staff take time to explain options without rushing appointments."
