        "en": "Gentle approach with dogs and cats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners emphasize how relaxed their dogs and cats feel throughout veterinary examinations and procedures. Multiple clients note that staff handle timid rescues and nervous senior pets with patience and care. Reviewers express gratitude that animals leave appointments happy, purring, or calmly walking on lead."
      }
    },
    {
