        "en": "Clean clinic with convenient underground parking"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight the clean, spacious, and inviting environment of the practice. Reviewers appreciate amenities such as complimentary refreshments and private consultation suites that keep pets calm. Multiple pet parents note that accessible underground parking makes arrivals and departures remarkably stress-free."
      }
    }
